    "explanations": {
      "RAISE": "The Button opens widest, so this is our widest 3-bet. Letting that range see a cheap flop in position is the biggest Big Blind mistake at any depth.",
      "CALL": "Getting 3.5-to-1 closing the action against the loosest range at the table. Folding too much is still a far bigger leak than calling slightly too wide.",
      "FOLD": "A smaller fold range than against anyone else, but tighter than it would be at 100bb - the bottom of a Big Blind defence lives on implied odds that 40bb does not provide."
    }
